d again whenever it changes. It lists which sensors this furnace has\ninstalled. Telemetry values are null for sensors that are not installed.\nSpeak at most one short sentence per event, and only if your judgment changed.\nIn this session the events so far arrive together in one message, one JSON object per line. Report your judgment as of the LAST event: call report_assessment exactly once.",
